packages/opencode/specs/tui-plugins.md:3:Technical reference for the current TUI plugin system.
packages/opencode/specs/tui-plugins.md:7:- TUI plugin config lives in `tui.json`.
packages/opencode/specs/tui-plugins.md:8:- Author package entrypoint is `@opencode-ai/plugin/tui`.
packages/opencode/specs/tui-plugins.md:9:- Internal plugins load inside the CLI app the same way external TUI plugins do.
packages/opencode/specs/tui-plugins.md:10:- Package plugins can be installed from CLI or TUI.
packages/opencode/specs/tui-plugins.md:11:- v1 plugin modules are target-exclusive: a module can export `server` or `tui`, never both.
